# Commands, phases, git

Always use **Bun** — never `npm`, `npx`, or `yarn`.

```bash
bun dev              # start dev server
bun run build        # production build
bun lint             # ESLint
bunx tsc --noEmit    # type-check only
bunx shadcn@latest add <item>
```

No automated tests. Verify with lint, type-check, build, and the browser.

## Phases

`docs/README.md` is the source of truth. Read it before assuming a feature, helper, or provider exists. Update its table when starting or finishing a phase. Do not rebuild landed work or implement a later phase uninvited.

**Do not build:** `CARD` checkout (`422 PAYMENT_METHOD_UNAVAILABLE` until backend Phase 7) or user notifications (no storefront endpoints yet). Ship CASH-only checkout.

## Git

Commit messages must **not** include a `Co-Authored-By` trailer or any Claude/Cursor/AI-attribution line.
